{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">珠海、香港、澳門三地出入境部門，在港珠澳大橋聯合舉行升國旗儀式。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.ZH.FLAG-2000_001.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026bHvU6nvMGA1790858806.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.ZH.FLAG-2000_001.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">升旗儀式在位於珠海的港珠澳大橋白海豚島舉行，來自珠海出入境邊檢站，聯合香港入境處及澳門治安警察局，三地執法人員首次聯合展示中式步操，是全國唯一由粵港澳三地部門聯合展開的國慶升旗活動。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.ZH.FLAG-2000_003.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026ENnQ0OkWkH1790858774.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.ZH.FLAG-2000_003.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">儀式結束後，三地青少年代表朗誦詩歌，全場合唱《歌唱祖國》。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-01T13:20:25.306358+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":154,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}